CODEGEN.md §5.9, §2.8, §4.2: a data value of another package's record has no home in gen/cpp: its static Load is a member of a class only that package's emit writes, so ForeignDataRecord at the value (unit CX, GC review probe p8).
-- b/b.canon --
package b

/// A shelf.
record Shelf {
  /// How many.
  n: Int
}

emit cpp { out: "@features/b", namespace: "b", mode: data }
-- a/a.canon --
package a

import b { Shelf }

/// The shelf.
let shelf: Shelf = { n: 1 }

emit cpp { out: "@features/a", namespace: "a", mode: data }
emit json { out: "out/" }
-- a.shelf.json --
{ "n": 1 }
-- findings.txt --
error[E8019]  a/a.canon:6:5
  emit cpp in data mode cannot generate a record or variant of another package read by a data loader

1 error, 0 warnings in 2 packages (…)
